TI  - 66G Obstetric and Gynecological Nursing: Expertise in Women's Health.
PG  - 56-58
AB  - The Army nurse in the 66G obstetric/gynecological nursing area of concentration 
      (AOC) plays a critical role in sustaining the health of female soldiers and 
      military families. While often associated with childbirth, the 66G's capabilities 
      extend beyond the delivery room. Their expertise enhances combat readiness, 
      humanitarian response, and population health efforts worldwide.
