TI  - [Dental health and the combat readiness].
PG  - 6-11, 86
AB  - Oral diseases are still amongst the most common human ailments in the western 
      world and in Israel. Acute dental illness may cause intense pain, malaise, 
      nutrition impairment, disturbance and loss of operative activities. The article 
      reviews the literature from the last two decades regarding dental classification 
      of military service candidates, incidence of acute dental conditions and 
      emergency treatment needs in military population, and dental preparation programs 
      for military recruits.
