AB  - We present characteristics of a new regulatory act issued by the Ministry of 
      Defense of the Russian Federation - Medical equipment supply rate for large 
      units, military units and facilities of the Armed Forces of the Russian 
      Federation in peacetime, prepared in the course of modernization of the system of 
      medical equipment rationing. New system of medical equipment rationing answers 
      modern requirements of the Armed Forces. Introduction of modern norms of medical 
      supply into practical activities of military regulatory bodies, medical units, 
      military units and organizations will increase the effectiveness and quality of 
      medical service, will help to maintain servicemen's health and will facilitate 
      the combat readiness of medical units.
