TI  - [Modern peculiarities of dynamics and structure of servicemen of Armed Forces of 
      Ukraine retiring in transitional period towards professional Army].
PG  - 134-41
AB  - Operational readiness of personnel of Armed Forces of Ukraine was studied in the 
      article based on peculiarities of dynamics and structure of retiring of all 
      categories of servicemen. It was established that high rates of retiring related 
      to specific classes of diseases indicate low health condition of servicemen which 
      has a negative impact on their combat readiness and further fitness for military 
      service. Priorities of changes in the process of completing of the Armed Forces 
      of Ukraine with human resources in the conditions of transformation to 
      professional Army, to include optimization of fitness for military service 
      criteria, were defined.
