      promotion of psychological health in cadets of the centre of operational use of 
      antitank artillery in conditions of steady increase of intensity and tension of 
      educational-and-professional activity. This technique provides the preservation 
      of psychological health and personal adaptive potential in military personnel. It 
      conduces to reduction of morbidity rate of psychological and personality 
      disorders and to combat readiness of units packed with graduates of training 
      centre.
